{"ticker":"BALRAMCHIN","symbol":"BALRAMCHIN","instrumentId":3022342,"name":"Balrampur Chini Mills Ltd","industry":"NSE-Food-Packaged","about":"Balrampur Chini Mills Limited (BCML),  is one of India’s leading sugar manufacturers, with a diversified portfolio that includes sugar, ethanol, alcohol, and renewable energy. Under the leadership of Mr. Vivek Saraogi, BCML has grown significantly, boasting a cane crushing capacity of 80,000 tonnes per day, a distillery capacity of 1,050 KL per day, and a saleable co-generation capacity of 175.7 megawatts. The company is known for its innovative manufacturing approach, creating valuable co-products like molasses, bagasse, and power. Committed to sustainability and operational efficiency, BCML plays a vital role in driving rural prosperity and contributing to India’s decarbonization efforts.","website":"www.chini.com","location":"Kolkata, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:07:20.948Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":639.5,"changePct":0.3215938504980711,"week52High":767.1,"week52Low":397.8},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹13,535 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹6,571 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"120,635,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"202"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"84,389,103"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.63%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.12"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.3"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"22.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.17"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.51"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"2%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"31.16"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"15–38"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"9.1%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"29.69"},{"label":"Volume","value":"385,934"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,203,548"},{"label":"Master score","value":"64"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"55"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"77"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"122"},{"label